@startuml F0.5-a-erro-5xx-incidentid
title F0.5-a — API 5xx → /erro/500 com incidentId
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuário" as Usuario
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "TanStack Query" as TQ
participant "API" as API

Usuario -> WebApp: ação qualquer
WebApp -> TQ: useQuery / useMutation
TQ -> API: HTTP request
API --> TQ: 5xx Problem Details\ninstance = INC-YYYY-XXXX

note right of TQ
  Interceptor global extrai instance
  navigate(/erro/500, { incidentId })
  RN-F0.5-05 / 09
end note

TQ --> WebApp: redireciona /erro/500
WebApp --> Usuario: tela 500\nID copiável (sem stack trace)

@enduml
